msgid "FlightDeck FrSky Taranis App"
msgstr "FlightDeck FrSky Taranis 应用"

#: ../../source/docs/common-frsky-flightdeck.rst:8
#: bc93e84898174250852952f59ce77f7a
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "概述"

#: ../../source/docs/common-frsky-flightdeck.rst:10
#: d5bf83168eac4422a93de4ec48fd0f1b
msgid ""
"`FlightDeck <http://www.craftandtheoryllc.com/flightdeck-taranis-opentx-"
"ardupilot-arducopter-pixhawk-2-cube-servo-frsky-x9d-x7-q-x7-qx7-telemetry-"
"smartport-smart-port-serial/>`__  by `Craft and Theory "
"<http://www.craftandtheoryllc.com>`__ allows easy viewing of flight modes, "
"altitude, speeds, attitude and critical system alerts including failsafes "
"and battery errors such as unbalanced cells warnings and low battery alerts "
"on your transmitters. As such, it is a good companion to Tower or Mission "
"Planner that adds extra confidence to your piloting."
msgstr ""
"`Craft and Theory <http://www.craftandtheoryllc.com>`__ 开发的 `FlightDeck "
"<http://www.craftandtheoryllc.com/flightdeck-taranis-opentx-ardupilot-"
"arducopter-pixhawk-2-cube-servo-frsky-x9d-x7-q-x7-qx7-telemetry-smartport-"
"smart-port-serial/>`__ "
"可在遥控器上方便地显示飞行模式、高度、速度、姿态以及关键系统报警，包括失控保护和电池错误（如电芯不平衡警告和低电量报警）。因此，它是 Tower 或 "
"Mission Planner 的良好搭档，为您的飞行操控增添额外信心。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-frsky-flightdeck.rst:16
#: 72f68f581aa040a5b39f117ca3d08026
msgid ""
"Complete documentation for FlightDeck is available `here "
"<http://www.craftandtheoryllc.com/downloads-and-documentation/>`__."
msgstr ""
"FlightDeck 的完整文档请访问 `此处 <http://www.craftandtheoryllc.com/downloads-and-"
"documentation/>`__。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-frsky-flightdeck.rst:21
#: c4577e99515647d4b53bf8c2c62b44c5
msgid "Turnkey Packages"
msgstr "一体化套装"

#: ../../source/docs/common-frsky-flightdeck.rst:29
#: 3080bd689f694946b9dc959283e31513
msgid ""
"Complete turnkey packages containing the required equipment for FrSky "
"telemetry with FlightDeck preinstalled on the Taranis are available `here "
"<http://www.craftandtheoryllc.com/product/package-flightdeck-taranis-opentx-"
"ardupilot-arducopter-pixhawk-2-cube-servo-frsky-x9d-x7-q-x7-qx7-telemetry-"
"smartport-smart-port-serial/#configuration>`__."
msgstr ""
"包含 FrSky 数传所需全套设备且已在 Taranis 上预装 FlightDeck 的一体化套装可在 `此处 "
"<http://www.craftandtheoryllc.com/product/package-flightdeck-taranis-opentx-"
"ardupilot-arducopter-pixhawk-2-cube-servo-frsky-x9d-x7-q-x7-qx7-telemetry-"
"smartport-smart-port-serial/#configuration>`__ 购买。"

