"Set the ``SERIAL#_PROTOCOL`` to ``10`` using your favorite GCS application."
msgstr "使用您喜欢的地面站应用将 ``SERIAL#_PROTOCOL`` 设置为 ``10``。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-frsky-flightdeck.rst:37
